{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:689","content":{"id":689,"title":"反转链表","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"51c6d006-1bc7-44e9-b325-5ef1f7145809","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反转链表"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"697b757e-4077-43a4-a8ea-dc0fa0b8a543","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c709e0a-751d-4537-b829-1b7df30cf962","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你单链表的头节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"head"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你反转链表，并返回反转后的链表。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddeca89a-2ff1-4337-b590-fe1e3c7c0088","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"66ea63c4-ec39-4e29-8044-4b20dc2a2305","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"09ad5a3f-c541-4c17-b959-024326ae0805","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5]\n输出：[5,4,3,2,1]","collabId":"e38b8eef-32a9-4347-afc6-4e9fc4fc7be7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a3e67da1-1031-44a5-b50c-d5306bc59810.webp","uuid":"5f5a2f05-30d1-4def-9d04-91f8fa685a4e","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a3e67da1-1031-44a5-b50c-d5306bc59810.webp","width":501.66664673222516,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"28f269eb-ef64-4a19-8e63-12fc9cfba3b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"bfd98827-275d-4960-ad21-59b078eb8e1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"17a8e980-d7a1-43ef-ac19-08209b8cb465","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一种解法，使用递归，分为两步，第一步对后续的链表进行反转，第二步将当前节点添加到已反转列表的最后，如下"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bb672c85-2efc-4dad-a073-7edda239905b.webp","uuid":"afc988d8-b1d4-48b8-89da-a506f5d1178d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bb672c85-2efc-4dad-a073-7edda239905b.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5a3ec5c5-5d2f-455a-a499-b6a6bc0b8c38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8da838a7-834e-497c-a4af-db56a30a6b51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反转后续节点的的操作同上，直至剩下最后一个节点，就不必反转了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f1eef57-2a93-45fb-a26f-cfbb93e192c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为我们需要将当前节点挂在已反转的节点的最后，所以我们需要知道最后一个节点是什么，通过图可以观察到，已反转链表的最后一个节点是当前节点在未反转链表中的下一个节点。例如当前节点 1，已反转链表的最后一个节点 2 是其在未反转链表中的下一个节点，所以我们在反转后续节点前可以先将此节点保存下来"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"04a8578b-f7b2-4ac2-93d3-62f98d16defb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c97648d9-e721-42e4-b0fd-94f081101e11","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {\n    if (head == null || head.next == null) {\n        return head;\n    }\n    ListNode next = head.next;\n    ListNode root = reverseList(head.next);\n    next.next = head;\n    head.next = null;\n    return root;\n}","collabId":"be222b92-4eed-49b6-8ea8-bef9f30bc1de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"baf4d0f5-9ca2-4cc9-ad54-23c9494f4f19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二种方法，借助于栈，根据栈的特点，后进先出，我们依次将链表中的元素添加进栈中，最后依次从栈中弹出元素，将其添加进一个新的链表中，然后返回该链表即可得到一个反序的链表"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b2dd7fed-da40-40db-9290-f35b776c05a5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"255390f3-76ef-47c7-819e-6957805bb1ed","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {\n    if (head == null || head.next == null) {\n        return head;\n    }\n    ListNode dummyHead = new ListNode();\n    ListNode cur = head;\n    LinkedList<ListNode> list = new LinkedList<>();\n    while (cur != null) {\n        list.push(cur);\n        cur = cur.next;\n    }\n    cur = dummyHead;\n    while (!list.isEmpty()) {\n        cur.next = list.pop();\n        cur = cur.next;\n    }\n    cur.next = null;\n    return dummyHead.next;\n}","collabId":"07d2385e-eda0-4a6c-a07a-c2afbd0fcbe8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0a06b28e-3aee-43cb-813a-4fd8c91f2269","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反转链表II"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5813eee2-3b2c-43bc-b309-16bbd90e402d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"925b7313-2e6b-42cd-b6d5-4388cb89c81f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你单链表的头指针 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"head"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和两个整数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"right"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left <= right"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。请你反转从位置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到位置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"right"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的链表节点，返回反转后的链表 。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09db0f62-7b3a-4c5f-bbcf-6fcb3c617bf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"c5dae6e2-879b-46fa-8fd8-8fde2ac6da40","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"80907773-4e01-4dde-909e-73e3ad0f5074","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], left = 2, right = 4\n输出：[1,4,3,2,5]","collabId":"963a9945-7e3a-4dd9-b11e-64d6af8bfe9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_865e4573-4424-408d-bc07-fb3d51d51971.webp","uuid":"65f41141-78f6-4686-8247-cedb6ee2c9d1","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_865e4573-4424-408d-bc07-fb3d51d51971.webp","width":501.66664673222516,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a3680c99-3248-43a0-80ac-d63ea11dfa4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"575d49eb-f95b-4382-bf50-7a88ca2d9664","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f000d1f9-3fad-4211-b669-dff3efe247f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还是一样，我们还是借助栈来反转链表，我们只需要将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[left, right]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 范围的添加进栈中即可，同样的我们还是构建一个新的链表，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以前的节点，直接添加到新链表中，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[left, right]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点，添加进栈中，然后依次取出添加进新链表中，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"right"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后面的节点，也是直接添加进新链表中，然后将新链表的根节点直接返回即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b037125e-aaa3-4aa1-b246-ba9e35557b4e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"efacdaef-4aea-4092-af94-d29ed4e84066","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode reverseBetween(ListNode head, int left, int right) {\n    ListNode dummyHead = new ListNode();\n    // 新链表的末尾\n    ListNode end = dummyHead;\n    // 当前遍历节点\n    ListNode cur = head;\n    // left 以前的节点，直接添加进新链表\n    for (int i = 1; i < left; i++) {\n        end.next = cur;\n        cur = cur.next;\n        end = end.next;\n    }\n    // [left, right] 中的节点，先添加进栈中，然后依次取出添加进新链表\n    LinkedList<ListNode> list = new LinkedList<>();\n    // 添加进栈中\n    for (int i = left; i <= right; i++) {\n        list.push(cur);\n        cur = cur.next;\n    }\n    // 从栈中取出，添加进新链表\n    while (!list.isEmpty()) {\n        end.next = list.pop();\n        end = end.next;\n    }\n    // right 后面的节点全部直接添加进新链表\n    end.next = cur;\n    return dummyHead.next;\n}","collabId":"f4c535db-7c84-43f4-bc84-7d42f47fe0d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"栈"},{"label":"反转链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:689","type":"doc","id":689}}],"prevPage":{"title":"包含 min 函数的栈","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:674","type":"doc","id":674}},"nextPage":{"title":"删除排序链表中的重复元素II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:700","type":"doc","id":700}},"createTime":1728991487076,"updateTime":1775928714088,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928714088}}